      "writtenOn": "2025-02-28T21:45:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yea, it\u0027s possible to have a really long chain of just repeatig structs. But if a client specifies that its sort of a user error? But yea, this ensures we won\u0027t recurse in those cases anymore though, so it would just take a long time?",
